    <briefdescription>
<para>These operations make, validate, encode and decode a Receiver Secret Key (RSK). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>An RSK is required to derive an SSV (see <ref refid="ja_2sakke_8h_1a456e97f619be9fd875f3939caf3def11" kindref="member">wc_DeriveSakkeSSV()</ref>).<linebreak/>
On the KMS, make an RSK (<ref refid="ja_2sakke_8h_1a80fa7df0d204b8402a3ca9166357a6c8" kindref="member">wc_MakeSakkeRsk()</ref>) from the client&apos;s ID.<linebreak/>
On the client, validate the RSK (<ref refid="ja_2sakke_8h_1a71d432b9a290e7527a12ada1ecdef9ec" kindref="member">wc_ValidateSakkeRsk()</ref>) with the ID.<linebreak/>
Encode the RSK (<ref refid="ja_2sakke_8h_1a331ab89daa227785d3e42e3a8708f5a3" kindref="member">wc_EncodeSakkeRsk()</ref>) to pass to client or for storage.<linebreak/>
Decode the RSK (<ref refid="ja_2sakke_8h_1a65b74643d963b984d636876f6a22b351" kindref="member">wc_DecodeSakkeRsk()</ref>) on the client when needed.<linebreak/>
Import the RSK (<ref refid="ja_2sakke_8h_1a8600d3450a8e38c75221bad3a596ef65" kindref="member">wc_ImportSakkeRsk()</ref>) on the client when needed.<linebreak/>
Set the RSK and, optionally, a pre-computation table (<ref refid="ja_2sakke_8h_1abed34ea9252ea8795a2bb1ac51138ee1" kindref="member">wc_SetSakkeRsk()</ref>) on the client when needed. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
